  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War sphere, forbidden lore class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you successfully use forbidden lore with a totem, all allies within the totem receive a morale bonus equal to your base forbidden lore bonus to one of the following, chosen by you when you create the totem: attack rolls, damage rolls, AC, saving throws, ability checks, skill checks, magic skill checks, or CMB and CMD. Bonuses to your forbidden lore bonus do not increase this bonus. Multiple totems can give allies multiple bonuses, but two similar bonuses do not stack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/thaumaturge#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
